      "Abstract": {
        "CopyrightInformation": "Copyright © 2013 Elsevier Masson SAS. All rights reserved.",
        "AbstractText": "We report a case of spontaneous break of the wide ligament revealed by an abdominal pelvic painful syndrome of rough appearance in 36 weeks+2 days with an acute foetal suffering and an important hemoperitoneal to a primigeste of 32 years. The laparotomy explorer allowed to make the diagnosis but the foetal forecast was dramatic. The foetal extraction has to be made as a matter of urgency and at the same time that the vascular haemostasis."
      },
